NeoSans-{Regular,Medium,SemiBold,Bold}.ttf are Inter (Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors,
https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter/license) merged with Noto Sans Armenian (Copyright 2022 The Noto Project
Authors, https://github.com/notofonts/armenian), cut at weights 400/500/600/700 and subset by tools/make_fonts.py.
Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org); the merged fonts are
too. "NeoSans" is a new name, so neither font's Reserved Font Name is used.

